note Trigger for references: references are grouped under a file row (xreffile/<file number>) with their count, which opens the file at its first line; each reference row (xref/<n>) shows its line number and the trimmed line, and a click queues GoTo, handled by open_line rather than go_to_symbol. Title lines take no clicks.

